B.bzG=new A.uS("The Obligation","O you who believe, fasting is prescribed for you as it was prescribed for those before you, that you may attain taqwa (2:183). The month of Ramadan in which the Quran was revealed (2:185). Two verses, one month, one purpose: a training in God-consciousness.")
B.bzJ=new A.uS("Who Fasts, Who Is Excused","The sick and the traveler may break the fast and make it up later (2:184) \u2014 and Allah intends for you ease and does not intend for you hardship (2:185). The exemption is the ruling itself showing mercy; using it is not a loophole.")
B.bzL=new A.uS("The Fast of the Tongue","The Prophet \ufdfa said: whoever does not give up false speech and acting upon it, Allah has no need of his leaving food and drink (Bukhari 1903). The stomach\u2019s fast is the easy part; the tongue\u2019s fast is where taqwa is built.")
